<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila c. bank raises term reverse repo rates.</title>
<headline>Manila c. bank raises term reverse repo rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Thursday it raised some of its term reverse repo rates (rrp).</p>
<p>Traders said the central bank was aligning its rates nearer to the market trend.</p>
<p>The two-month reverse repo was increased to 13.55 percent from 13 percent; the three-month, up to 13.75 percent from 13.25 percent; and the one-year rrp, up to 14.25 percent from 13.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8937</p>
</text>
